[0.009, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m▝▜\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m█████\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOpus 5.5 with high effort · Claude Pro\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m~/projects/jettison\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⚠\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;255;193;7mCode Mode (experimental) is on · this session can be resumed only with Code Mode on\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\u001b[1C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mYes, it's safe to /clear. Both repos are clean and everything is committed:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Jettison: at f14c288. Your local copy of the remote branch already includes it, so it looks pushed, but I haven't \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mfetched to confirm.\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Manifest: at 8c86722, the Tracy zones commit; its hash changed when I amended it. Nothing in Manifest is pushed.\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mOne task is still open and only this conversation knows about it: Manifest's SDK pin (MANIFEST_JETTISON_REVISION in \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msource/external/CMakeLists.txt) is still 0f973b2 and needs to move to f14c288. Until it does, Manifest's GitHub CI \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mparity check fails. After clearing, start with something like:\u001b[39m                                                        \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mRe-pin Manifest's MANIFEST_JETTISON_REVISION to Jettison f14c288 (the profilers devenv change), then W19 slice 4.\u001b[39m     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GDeliberating… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Use /config to change your default permission mode (including Plan Mode)\r\u001b[3B❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m (shift+tab to cycle) · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
