01b[82Gcompany's\u001b[92Glast\u001b[97Gprice\u001b[103Gfor\u001b[107Geach\u001b[112Gsupply\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B(D-100).\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  - \u001b[1mFees:\u001b[22m a docking fee when a journey starts and a berth fee for each hour\u001b[79Gdocked,\u001b[87Gset\u001b[91Gby\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Gship's\u001b[105Gpad\u001b[109Gclass\r\u001b[1B      (D-100).\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B    - \u001b[1mTravel:\u001b[22m the cruise follows the drive's power-law profile (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCruiseDrive\u001b[39m), and the policy's route estimate counts\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B    only those fees and life support\u001b[40G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPolicy::Charges\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BIf fuel exists,\u001b[21Git\u001b[24Gwould\u001b[30Gbe\u001b[33Gin\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gengine's\u001b[49Gcruise\u001b[56Gor\u001b[59Gspace\u001b[65Gmodules\u001b[73Gor\u001b[76Gin\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81GManifest\u001b[90Gdoc\u001b[94GI\u001b[96Ghaven't\u001b[104Gopened.\u001b[112GTo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3m↑/↓\u001b[10Gscroll · c to copy · f to fork · Esc to close\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H"]
