[0.142, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1342 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   a shortage pulling a cargo in and a glut sending one away, fast-forwarded to the same bytes.      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1342 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   a shortage pulling a cargo in and a glut sending one away, fast-forwarded to the same bytes.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m Done\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1343 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   2026-11-22: `Trade::Budget`, `TenderPrice` (the lowest ask on the venue's book, or the native     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1344 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   price) and `Reliefs` (each need past `kReliefPressure`, its day's shortfall in whole totes of     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1345 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   its cheapest good, at `kReliefUrgency` times the pressure), in the `trade` suite. Six days of the \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1346 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   fixture with two traders made no shortage or glut of their own, every broker near its target,     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1347 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   so the fixture's `fixture_prices` makes them: Bo buying out Brine's furs through the book turns   \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1348 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   Ada's first job from copper (an estimate of 9,542) to Ore's furs for Brine (26,615), and a        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1349 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   windfall of five times Brine's copper target has her buy copper there and carry it to Ore; each   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1350 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   fast-forwarded to the bytes stepping leaves. Every pin unmoved.                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 1351 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m5.\u001b[16GClose-out.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1352 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 1353 \u001b[22m ## Handoff\u001b[24Gto\u001b[27Gstage\u001b[33G5\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[11G\u001b[39m\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell comm\u001b[25Gd…\u001b[K\r\u001b[12C\u001b[3B\u001b[K\r\u001b[22C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
