G breaks the fixture's \"only \u001b[79Gommands\u001b[87Gaft\u001b[91Gr\u001b[93Gb\u001b[95Gotstra\u001b[102G\" style, as the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexisting \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mprofile.reset()\u001b[39m already does. If you'd\u001b[51Grather\u001b[61Gse sho\u001b[68Gtages come \u001b[80Gut of a long\u001b[93Gnatural run, it would n\u001b[117Ged\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent changes or many simul\u001b[33Gted days\u001b[42Gper test.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNot checked:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[22Gprices\u001b[29Gsettling\u001b[38Gover\u001b[43Glong\u001b[48Gruns\u001b[53Gis\u001b[56Gstill\u001b[62Gopen;\u001b[68GI've\u001b[73Gleft\u001b[78Git\u001b[81Gfor\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gclose-out\u001b[99G(slice 5).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mShortcut:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTenderPrice\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mReliefs\u001b[39m r\u001b[41Gbuild the market ru\u001b[61Ges from content on eve\u001b[84Gy call, as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mQuote\u001b[39m alr\u001b[105Gady does.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThere's a\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mshortcut:\u001b[39m comment saying W12 should\u001b[51Gkeep \u001b[57Ghe rules if\u001b[69Ga profile shows the call\u001b[95Gcost too much.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mGate time:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfix\u001b[20Gure_cruise\u001b[39m \u001b[32Gook 576\u001b[40Gs under ASan at\u001b[56G24 parallel jobs, which made\u001b[89Gg\u001b[91Gte ab\u001b[97Gu\u001b[100G17 minutes.\u001b[112GI\u001b[114Gdidn't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gchange that test; the slowd\u001b[33Gwn\u001b[36Gmay\u001b[40Gbe from\u001b[48Gearlier\u001b[56Gslices or from running 24 jobs at once. It's worth a look\u001b[114Gbefore\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[7Ge close-ou\u001b[18G.   \u001b[23G   \u001b[27G        \u001b[36G   \u001b[40G  \u001b[43G    \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
