[0.176, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mgating beside the work\u001b[39m](build-and-gates.md#gating-beside-the-work)). A ship steered in a station's\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[11G\u001b[22mframe still runs every step, which is most of the zero-cl\u001b[69Gent run's st\u001b[82Gps.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/p\u001b[13Goj\u001b[16Gcts/manife\u001b[27Gt/build/commit-w21-booked.txt)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m8\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[20Gto\u001b[23G\u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-w21-booked.txt\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22mDocs: fuel burn, D-107, booked as W21 at high priority\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[9G\u001b[22mThe user's: a ship's drive burns fuel\u001b[47Gto\u001b[50Gaccele\u001b[57Gate, and\u001b[66Ghow\u001b[70Ghard\u001b[75Git\u001b[78Gburns\u001b[84Gis\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[9G\u001b[22ma\u001b[11Gchoice\u001b[18Gin\u001b[21Gplanning\u001b[30Ga\u001b[32Groute,\u001b[39Ga\u001b[41Gfaster\u001b[48Grun\u001b[52Gfor\u001b[56Gmore\u001b[61Gruns\u001b[66Gor\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gslower\u001b[78Gone\u001b[82Gfor\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[9G\u001b[22mless fuel. Recorded in th\u001b[36Gsmall-ship\u001b[47Gplan with i\u001b[59Gs open\u001b[66Gchoices,\u001b[75Gbooked next\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[10G\u001b[22mfter W19 and before\u001b[30GW12; D-049's LPG and the roadmap point\u001b[69Gto it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[9G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[9G\u001b[22mCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m4\u001b[22