[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G - \u001b[1mCoast (recommended):\u001b[29G\u001b[22mburn up to\u001b[40Ga cruise sp\u001b[52Ged, coast, t\u001b[65Gen\u001b[68Gb\u001b[70Grn\u001b[73Gto stop. It needs a small, reu\u001b[104Gable Jettison\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B     change: an optio\u001b[25Gal coast phase\u001b[40Gin\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gcruise\u001b[54Gprofile.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mThrottle:\u001b[18G\u001b[22maccelerate\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gwhole\u001b[39Gway\u001b[43Gat\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Glower\u001b[54Grate.\u001b[60GNo\u001b[63Gengine\u001b[70Gchange,\u001b[78Gbut\u001b[82Git\u001b[85Gsaves\u001b[91Gmuch\u001b[96Gless\u001b[101Gfuel\u001b[106Gfor\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gsame\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G     extra time.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mCargo weight in the burn.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m     - \u001b[1mYes (recommended):\u001b[22m fuel scales with the hull's mass plus the cargo's, so heavy cheap goods tend to go slow and\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Blight\u001b[14Gvaluable\u001b[23Gones\u001b[28Gfast.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   - \u001b[1mNo:\u001b[22m every cargo faces the same trade-off.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRefuelling.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   - \u001b[1mAt the pump (recommended):\u001b[22m a R\u001b[39Gfuel comman\u001b[51G buys\u001b[57Ghy\u001b[60Grogen from the\u001b[75Gvenu\u001b[80G's market straight in\u001b[102Go the tanks. Liquid\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B     hyd\u001b[12Gogen packs only about 8\u001b[36Gkg into a tote, so\u001b[55G600\u001b[59Gkg loaded through th\u001b[81Ghold would take 75 of the starter's 160\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B     totes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mThrough the hold:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mas\u001b[29Goxygen\u001b[36Gworks\u001b[42Gtoday.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G4. \u001b[1mWhat a standing policy optimises when it picks the burn.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m     - \u001b[1mProfit per hour, with an override (recommended):\u001b[22m by default the policy\u001b[79Gpicks\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtrade\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gburn\u001b[104Gthat\u001b[109Gmake\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  most per hour of the job, counting fuel and the oxygen used in transit. You can fix a\u001b[94Gburn\u001b[99Gshare\u001b[105Gon\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Gpolicy\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B  instead.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mProfit per run:\u001b[22m this nearly always means the slowest burn.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mYour setting:\u001b[22m the\u001b[26Gpolicy\u001b[33Gjust\u001b[38Gflies\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gburn\u001b[56Gshare\u001b[62Gyou\u001b[66Ggive\u001b[71Git.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for \u001b[24Gdone 2:56 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;87H\u001b[?25h"]
