[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  \u001b[6G- \u001b[1mAt the pump (recommended):\u001b[35G\u001b[22ma\u001b[37GRefuel\u001b[44Gcommand\u001b[52Gbuys\u001b[57Ghydrogen\u001b[66Gfrom\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gvenue's\u001b[83Gmarket\u001b[90Gstraight\u001b[99Ginto\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gtanks.\u001b[115GLiquid\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8Ghydrogen packs only about 8 kg into\u001b[44Ga tote,\u001b[52Gso 600 kg loaded through th\u001b[80G hold would t\u001b[94Gke 75 of the s\u001b[110Grter's 160\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Btotes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mThrough the hold:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mas\u001b[29Goxygen\u001b[36Gworks\u001b[42Gtoday.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mWhat a standing policy optimises when it picks the burn.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[6G- \u001b[1mProfit per hour, with an override (recommended):\u001b[22m by default\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gpolicy\u001b[79Gpicks\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtrade\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gburn\u001b[104Gthat\u001b[109Gmake\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8Gmost per hour of the job, counting fuel and the ox\u001b[59Ggen used\u001b[68Gin transit. You can fix a burn\u001b[99Gshare on the policy\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[12Gead.\u001b[17G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mProfit per run:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mthis\u001b[29Gnearly\u001b[36Galways\u001b[43Gmeans\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Gslowest\u001b[61Gburn.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mYour setting:\u001b[22m the policy just flies at the burn share you give\u001b[71Git.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 2m 52s · done 2:56 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mFuel is a new type of drive fuel specific to the ships. Name to be decided upon. LPG is for cooking and vehicles on \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mplanet\u001b[11Gwhere\u001b[17Gsolar an\u001b[26G other \u001b[34Gnergy types are le\u001b[53Gs \u001b[56Gractical. Higher accelerations should use the fuel\u001b[107Gmore rapidly.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BCargo weight and ship weig\u001b[30Gt both affect the burn rate. Space stations \u001b[75Gan offer refueling\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98Git shou\u001b[106Gd be \u001b[39m         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mavailable automatically the same as life\u001b[44Gsupport is (funds avail\u001b[68Gble, and at the\u001b[84Gdiscretion of\u001b[98Gthe player, maybe a \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheckbox in \u001b[16Ghe UI to enable this feature).\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNoted:\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G-\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
