[0.083, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mThrough the hold:\u001b[22m as oxygen\u001b[36Gworks today.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mWhat a standing policy optimises when it picks the burn.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BProfit per hour, with an override (recommended):\u001b[57G\u001b[22mby\u001b[60Gdefault\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gpolicy\u001b[79Gpicks\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtrade\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gburn\u001b[104Gthat\u001b[109Gmake\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G  most per hour of the job, counting fuel and the oxygen\u001b[63Gused\u001b[68Gin\u001b[71Gtransit.\u001b[80GYou\u001b[84Gcan\u001b[88Gfix\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gburn\u001b[99Gshare\u001b[105Gon\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Gpolicy\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8Ginstead.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mProfit per run:\u001b[22m this\u001b[29Gnearly always\u001b[43Gmeans the slowest burn.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8G\u001b[1mYour setting:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[26Gpolicy\u001b[33Gjust\u001b[38Gflies\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gburn\u001b[56Gshare\u001b[62Gyou\u001b[66Ggive\u001b[71Git.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 2m 52s · done 2:56 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mFuel is a new type of drive fuel specific to the ships. Name to be decided upon. LPG is for cooking and vehicles on \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mplanets where solar and other energy types are less practical. Higher accelerations should use the fuel more rapidly.\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mCargo weight and ship\u001b[25Gwe\u001b[28Gght both affect the\u001b[48Gburn rate\u001b[59GSpace stations can\u001b[78Goffer\u001b[84Grefueling and it should be \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mav\u001b[6Gilable automatically\u001b[27Gthe same as life \u001b[45Gupport i\u001b[55G(funds \u001b[63Gvailabl\u001b[71G