2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mBurn hard to a cruise speed, coast unpowered, burn hard to stop. Saves the most fuel for the extra time: a quarter \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mof the fuel takes Ore→Brine from 4.5 to about 9 days. Needs a small, reusable Jettison change: an optional coast \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bphase in the cruise profile.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[39m Throttle\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAccelerate the whole way, just more gently (e.g. 0.25 g instead of 1 g). No engine change, but half the fuel only \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mbuys about twice\u001b[23Gthe time, and it can't go below the fuel of the 2 g boost hours.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0012 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
