[0.059, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 1446 \u001b[22m 3. The burn: `Travel`'s `burnBps`, the profile for a share, fuel burned by mass and speed change,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1447 \u001b[22m    `InsufficientFuel`; refuelling and `SetRefuel`, the account short and the flag off (`travel`,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1448 \u001b[22m    `company`).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/build/commit-w21-curve.txt)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote \u001b[1m10\u001b[22m lines to \u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-w21-curve.txt\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22mPlan: W21's fuel burned on a curve of the acceleration, tanks grown on the tree\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22mThe\u001b[14Guser's: a km/s costs\u001b[35Gthe accelerati\u001b[50Gn in g squared \u001b[66Gbov\u001b[70G 1 g, so a hard\u001b[86G\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[10G\u001b[22mburn is punishingly expensive but can win a ra\u001b[57Ge,\u001b[60Gs\u001b[62Gch as to colonise a new\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 5 \u001b[22msystem; a journey choos\u001b[34Gs its acceleration\u001b[53Gwithi\u001b[59G th\u001b[64Gmode's caps as well as\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[10G\u001b[22mits burn. T\u001b[22Ge mass bu\u001b[32Gned against is every\u001b[53Ghing aboard: hull, fuel\u001b[77Gtanks and\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[10G\u001b[22mtheir fuel, occ\u001b[26Gpants\u001b[32Gand passengers, and cargo.\u001b[59GThe tanks\u001b[69Gare apar\u001b[78G from the\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22mhold and\u001b[19Ggrow on th\u001b[31Gtech tree, the s\u001b[48Garter given a Fuel Bunkers slot and offer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[10G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m10\u001b[10G\u001b[22mCo-Authored-By:\u001b[26GClaude\u001b[33GOpus\u001b[38G5.5\u001b[42G<noreply@anthropic.com>\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m6\u001b[26G\u001b[22ms…\r\u001b[35C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mjettison\u001b[46Glog --oneline -2\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
