G2 g,\u001b[64G16 times at 4\u001b[78Gg \u001b[82Gd 144 \u001b[89Gimes at 12\u001b[100Gg. A journey now\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bhoo\u001b[10Ges i\u001b[15Gs acceleration, up \u001b[35Go the g\u001b[43Gm\u001b[45G mode's caps,\u001b[59Gas well\u001b[67Gas how much of the full burn to use.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mExample:\u001b[22m \u001b[15Go\u001b[17Gcross from Ore to Brin\u001b[40G, th\u001b[46Gstarter burns about 453\u001b[70Gkg at 1 g. An unmanned 20\u001b[97G ship racing\u001b[110Gat\u001b[113G12\u001b[116Gg\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwould need about 197 t\u001b[28Gof fuel and arrive in 1.34 day\u001b[59G, an expensive way\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Gwin a rac\u001b[91G to colon\u001b[101Gse \u001b[105G system.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEverything aboard counts toward the mass:\u001b[47G\u001b[22mthe hull, the\u001b[61Gfuel ta\u001b[69Gks (0.25\u001b[79G of tank per\u001b[94Gnne \u001b[99Gf cap\u001b[105Gcity), the\u001b[116Gfuel\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gin them, the people aboard (100 kg each),\u001b[76G oxygen \u001b[86Gd\u001b[88Gca\u001b[91Gtridg\u001b[98Gtotes.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
